## The exact sign mechanism

Set $a=\sinh^2x$ and $b=\sinh^2y$. After multiplication by a positive denominator, $-K$ is governed by $a+3b+2ab+b^2+ab^2$. Every term is nonnegative, and all vanish only when $x=y=0$.

